{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle 10 of the great classical composers in this epic classical bullet hell. Get stronger as you advance through the fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win against each of them by doging their projectile and attacking with your own. Each victory give you a bonus of your choice in this list:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One or two lifes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A faster shooting speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faster bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Faster movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each victory, the action will get more intense as your enemies will have more health and more difficult shooting patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing the game is easy, only stir yourself in the 2D plane to dodge your ennemy bullets. While escaping their attacts, get back at them with projectiles of your own.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574930?t=1743308444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574930?t=1743308444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574930/3003dbdd0a9ddcb2709a7c17170fc1a2c379b6dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743308444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574930/3003dbdd0a9ddcb2709a7c17170fc1a2c379b6dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743308444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle 10 of the great classical composers in this epic classical bullet hell. Get stronger as you advance through the fights. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Win against each of them by doging their projectile and attacking with your own. Each victory give you a bonus of your choice in this list:</p><ul class=\"b